        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bbb2fc36-d28f-41ee-9a36-ac6ca290680e).Image",
        "Description": "It seems like Ms. Carlisle is more resilient than we thought, as she was spotted alive only days ago. And she&apos;s  been busy. She recovered most of her wealth, and has locked it away in an offshore bank. The only way to access it is through a double key, one half given to her butler and one given to her daughter, Rebecca. Both of the keys are sealed through DNA, which makes the two targets. Also, we have unmasked two members of staff as undercover agents for a rival business. You know what to do.",
